                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "I think the only reason to purchase this game is because it is dog themed, they really got me when I saw a PUG BADGE, so yeah I ended up buying it.\n\nBut I have to say that the game is old and outdated, so no fullscreen or 16:9 avaible and I have to warn you that there's a small  delay when you click in the next card on your deck, you will probally notice it on long sessions, it really bothers you after a while.\n\nNow the good aspects, I can mention that the game is easy to complete (if you're looking for the achievements) and because it is dog themed, other than that stick with the old microsoft solitaire's.",
